---
// src/pages/dossier.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Lore & Sector Dossier | Dr. Besen Roy Hull</title>
    <!-- is:inline keeps Tailwind CDN active -->
    <script is:inline src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-mono min-h-screen p-4 sm:p-6" style="background-color: #020617; color: #f1f5f9; font-family: monospace;">
    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-emerald-500/30 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/10" style="max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);">
      
      <!-- Top Bar / Return Link -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center text-xs text-emerald-500 mb-6 border-b border-emerald-500/20 pb-3 gap-2" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); padding-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <a href="/" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">&lt;&lt; RETURN_TO_TERMINAL</a>
        <span style="color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.7);">ARCHIVE_INDEX: SECTOR_7B</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Dossier Header -->
      <header class="mb-6" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">[ ARCHIVAL_DOSSIER: SUBJECT_VELCH ]</div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400" style="font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: #34d399; margin: 0;">The Legend of Grader Velch</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Declassified Research Notes & Sector Anomalies</p>
      </header>

      <!-- Primary Subject Overview -->
      <section style="background-color: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); border-radius: 0.375rem; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1rem; color: #34d399; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem;">// SUBJECT_PROFILE: VELCH, G.</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Operative Grader Velch remains one of the most polarizing figures in non-linear galactic history. Depending on which sector records you intercept, Velch is either a tactical genius who single-handedly reshaped hyper-dimensional strategy, or the catalyst for the most catastrophically absurd misunderstandings in the known universe.
        </p>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; margin: 0;">
          The archives below contain verified logs, unverified rumors, and redacted incident filings regarding his alleged "Legend."
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Archive Log Entries -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1rem; color: #34d399; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">// INTERCEPTED_DOSSIERS</h2>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding: 0.875rem; background-color: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.5); border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 0 0.25rem 0.25rem 0;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            <span>[ FILE_081-A ]</span>
            <span>STATUS: DECLASSIFIED</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #6ee7b7; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; font-weight: bold;">Incident Report: The Outer Rim Miscalculation</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.825rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Initial field notes on how Velch managed to turn a routine cargo audit into a sub-sector diplomatic crisis.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding: 0.875rem; background-color: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.5); border-left: 3px solid #10b981; border-radius: 0 0.25rem 0.25rem 0;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            <span>[ FILE_081-B ]</span>
            <span>STATUS: RESTRICTED</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #6ee7b7; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; font-weight: bold;">Tactical Analysis: Causality & Luck</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.825rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Dr. Roy Hull's non-linear thesis evaluating whether Velch possesses genuine foresight or is simply mathematically impossible to eliminate.</p>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;">
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b;">INDEX_REF: VELCH-LEGEND-V1</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #10b981;">[MORE_FILES_PENDING]</span>
      </footer>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>
          
